{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write from Koblenz, weary but safe. The journey from Kassel was a comedy of discomfort. Six souls crammed into the coach, three to a seat, with the river Lahn rushing past our windows. I sat facing backward, as is my custom, directly opposite a Göttingen student who clung to the rear seat marked number one with a tenacity that bordered on the pathological. He seemed less a traveler than a fixture of the carriage.\n\nWe followed the Lahn, the water mirroring the grey sky, while I tried to read a newspaper over the rattle of the wheels. The Englishman who accompanied me to Kassel stayed behind, leaving me to the mercies of the driver and the heat. I am glad to be stationary again. The air here is cool, and I have ordered a bottle of wine to soothe my nerves and my back.\n\nI think of you and the boys. The house feels distant, yet the thought of returning to our calm is my greatest comfort.\n\nYour loving\nHegel"}}],"created":1795080176,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":221,"prompt_tokens":941,"total_tokens":1162,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-4azNDUS0HGwTXrF3A2whAxhr0tRFwftN","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":941,"prompt_ms":926.57,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9846652497343252,"prompt_per_second":1015.573567026776,"predicted_n":221,"predicted_ms":5255.711,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.889595454545457,"predicted_per_second":41.85922703892965}}